## Key Design Decisions
- Per-project monotonic sequence computed inside Transaction (not Database) to avoid Mutex re-acquisition
- with_event helper pattern: begin tx -> closure -> compute seq -> emit event -> commit
- OperationStore methods cannot be called inside with_event closure (Mutex deadlock) - closure must use txn.conn() directly
- V11 uses project_event_id BLOB as global PK + UNIQUE(project_id, sequence) composite
- EventSource reconstructed from Display string in row_to_event (not serde)
